    <h2>Step 4: Find Out How Much You Need to Save Every Month</h2>
    <p>A target corpus is useless without a savings plan. The amount depends on three things: your target corpus, your time horizon, and your expected rate of return. A blended portfolio of equity mutual funds and government schemes can reasonably return 10 to 11% over 20 to 25 years. To estimate the monthly SIP needed for a specific corpus target, use the <a href="/india/goal-sip-calculator/">Goal-Based SIP Calculator</a>.</p>

